\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Phase portraits of the deterministic FitzHugh$-$Nagumo model for different values of input current $I$. The nullclines are shown in red lines and the stationary points are marked with dots. The trajectories illustrate the dynamics of the system in the $v$-$w$ plane.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
